# 名称：OneDrive 同步与存储
# 本地整理日期：2026-11-04；正文沿用用户此前的本地规则。
# 来源原文：sources/local/onedrive-sync.snippet；不冒充 V2Fly 社区规则。
# 边界：按目标域名划分，无法保证区分网页与同步客户端；两份规则存在交叉。
# 使用：Web 条目优先于 Sync；force-policy 决定实际策略。共享登录和租户域名可能影响其他 Microsoft 服务。
# 用户既有规则的候选整理副本；2026-10-19
# 原文件：onedrive_sync_filter.snippet；未修改iCloud原文件
# 去向由主配置 force-policy 指定；仅保留域名条件
host-suffix, onedrive.live.com, proxy
host-suffix, onedrive.com, proxy
host-suffix, files.1drv.com, proxy
host-suffix, storage.live.com, proxy
host-suffix, livefilestore.com, proxy
host-suffix, docs.live.net, proxy
host-suffix, policies.live.net, proxy
host-suffix, groups.office.live.com, proxy
host-suffix, groups.photos.live.com, proxy
host-suffix, groups.skydrive.live.com, proxy
host-suffix, storage.msn.com, proxy
host-suffix, sharepoint.com, proxy
host-suffix, sharepointonline.com, proxy
host, api.live.net, proxy
host, apis.live.net, proxy
host, api.onedrive.com, proxy
host, favorites.live.com, proxy
host, photos.live.com, proxy
host, skydrive.live.com, proxy
host, settings.live.net, proxy
host, skyapi.live.net, proxy
host, snapi.live.net, proxy
host, p.sfx.ms, proxy
host, oneclient.sfx.ms, proxy
host, spoprod-a.akamaihd.net, proxy
